#. USD hierarchy merge behavior, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:467.
msgid ""
"Merge USD primitives with their Xform parent if possible. USD does not "
"allow nested ``UsdGeomGprims``, intermediary Xform prims will be defined "
"to keep the USD file valid when encountering object hierarchies."
msgstr ""
"Sammanfoga om möjligt USD-primitiver med deras Xform-förälder. USD "
"tillåter inte nästlade ``UsdGeomGprims``; mellanliggande Xform-prims "
"definieras för att USD-filen ska förbli giltig vid objekthierarkier."

#. USD mesh triangulation, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:472.
msgid ""
"Triangulates the mesh before writing. For more detail on the specific "
"option see the :doc:`Triangulate modifier "
"</modeling/modifiers/generate/triangulate>`."
msgstr ""
"Triangulerar meshen före skrivning. Mer information om alternativet finns "
"i :doc:`trianguleringsmodifieraren "
"</modeling/modifiers/generate/triangulate>`."

#. USD material subset explanation, ../../manual/files/import_export/usd.rst:504.
msgid ""
"When a mesh has multiple materials assigned, a geometry subset is created"
" for each material. The first material (if any) is always applied to the "
"mesh itself as well (regardless of the existence of geometry subsets), "
"because the Hydra viewport does not support materials on subsets. See "
"`USD issue #542 "
"<https://github.com/PixarAnimationStudios/USD/issues/542>`__ for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"När en mesh har flera tilldelade material skapas en geometridelmängd för "
"varje material. Det första materialet, om något, tillämpas alltid också på "
"själva meshen, oavsett om geometridelmängder finns, eftersom Hydra-vyn "
"inte stöder material på delmängder. Se `USD-ärende nr 542 "
"<https://github.com/PixarAnimationStudios/USD/issues/542>`__ för mer "
"information."

